{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51776","headline":"诏福建置惠民仓呈陈守御史 · 詹琲","name":"诏福建置惠民仓呈陈守御史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闽邦赤子近来王，圣主忧勤念远方。\n酌取古人救荒政，颁爲今日惠民仓。\n备先水旱民亡瘠，弊在侵移数谩张。\n我愿相君谨刑政，雨阳时若自平康。\n（同上七五一八「仓」字韵引詹琲《清隐集》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹琲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}